WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:04,870
Brother, why are there too many and no food?

2
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:06,950
You almost died when you went out.

3
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:08,870
It’s okay if there are multiple people without food, that’s it

4
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:11,350
Thank you. Thank you brother for your thoughtfulness.

5
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:12,790
Most of the water in the market is river water

6
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:14,910
You have to boil it before you can drink it, which is a waste of wood and troublesome.

7
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:16,390
You can drink the water from Shanquange directly

8
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:17,510
We didn't find any water source

9
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:18,870
It's always good to have a good relationship with him

10
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:21,630
I hope this guy can live longer.

11
00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:24,910
Otherwise it would be really hard to find someone to get fresh water.

12
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,510
This grassland is full of burrows

13
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,350
No river was found in the forest today

14
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:30,110
Why don't you ask for more tomorrow?

15
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:32,310
If he died that day, wouldn't it be possible to replace him?

16
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:33,550
OK, contact him tomorrow

17
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:35,390
But we have to stock up on the meat we eat.

18
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:37,270
Use the extra meat to eat first.

19
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:42,290
Senior, you are pretty good at thinking and you can even make chopsticks.

20
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:43,770
Hi, rural people

21
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:45,130
What kind of housework did you play when you were a kid?
